  "scope": "One fresh local Kubernetes v1.36.1 Kind cluster. A builder Job reads two mounted fixture materials (source and dependency), normalizes the source into an intermediate product, and combines that intermediate with the dependency to produce a final artifact. The Job reports the bytes and SHA-256 digests it actually consumed and produced. The host signs separate in-toto Statement v1 DSSE payloads for the material set and artifact products using distinct ephemeral keys. A separate verifier Job checks both signatures and exact expected contents; a validly signed incomplete materials statement must be rejected. This does not establish production builder identity, protected key custody, trusted independent evidence generation, durable storage, or production CI/CD coverage.",
